          "summary": "Narrow Section 6.1 exclusivity so it binds the Company only as to a Deerskin-branded Site, with carve-outs for other channels, internal development and acquisitions",
          "comment": "[Playbook] We cannot accept restrictions on the products we may source, build or sell, so we have narrowed Section 6.1 to protect HDI's exclusivity for the Deerskin-branded Site only and added carve-outs for other channels, internal development and acquisitions. Our preferred position is deletion of any restriction on the Company; this narrowed form is offered as a compromise given HDI's investment in the Site.",
